an><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\varphi,x,s,b,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\varphi,x,s,b,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md\">../batch13/58-df-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"58-df-elementary-substructure\">58-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> are the formula, assignment and satisfaction predicates</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}vaught}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\bigl(\n(\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\!\\left(\\varphi,\n(s\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,b\\rangle\\}\\right))\n\\to\n\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\!\\left(\\varphi,\n(s\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,b\\rangle\\}\\right)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}vaught}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\bigl(\n(\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\!\\left(\\varphi,\n(s\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,b\\rangle\\}\\right))\n\\to\n\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\!\\left(\\varphi,\n(s\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,b\\rangle\\}\\right)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tarski–Vaught test for elementary substructures.</li>\n<li>It checks witnesses are in the submodel.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"563f382027630287","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnch